<title>FRANCE: Block of 200,000 Schneider shares traded.</title>
<headline>Block of 200,000 Schneider shares traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 200,000 Schneider shares traded at 1057 GMT, at 257.80 francs per share, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The stock was up 3.92 percent at 257.10 francs at 1110 GMT. A number of brokers have recommended the stock since Schneider agreed in December to sell its Spie Batignolles construction subsidiary to Amec Plc and Spie employees for one billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
